From: ViKing <viking.yfy@qq.com>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 14:06:01 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] backports: relax the kernel build version check

Adjust the kernel version check used by the backports build so the
OpenWrt kernel build layout is accepted.

Original author was not recorded in the imported patch.
[viking.yfy@qq.com: complete imported patch metadata]
Signed-off-by: ViKing <viking.yfy@qq.com>
---
--- a/Makefile
+++ b/Makefile
@@ -2,7 +2,7 @@
 # Makefile for the output source package
 #
 
-ifeq ($(KERNELRELEASE),)
+ifeq ($(KERNELVERSION),)
 
 MAKEFLAGS += --no-print-directory
 SHELL := /usr/bin/env bash
